{"headword":"לִשְׁכָּה","parent_lexicon":"BDB Dictionary","content":{"senses":[{"definition":"<strong>n.f. room, chamber, hall, cell, lishka (</strong>NH <em>id.</em> 𝔗 <span dir=\"rtl\">לִשְׁכְּתָא</span>; cf. also <a data-ref=\"BDB, נִשְׁכָּה\" href=\"/BDB,_נִשְׁכָּה\", dir=\"rtl\">נִשְׁכָּה</a>; on the <em>lishka</em> v. Now<sup>Arch. ii. 37, 52, 79</sup>; Bö<sup>Geogr. I, xvii. 438 (ed. Leusd.)</sup> comp. Gk. λέσχη, cf. RS<sup>Sem. i. 236 (2nd ed. 254)</sup> al.<strong>)</strong>;—<span dir=\"rtl\">ל׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 40:38\" href=\"/Ezekiel.40.38\">Ez 40:38</a> +; cstr. <span dir=\"rtl\">לִשְׁכַּת</span> <a data-ref=\"II Kings 23:11\" href=\"/II_Kings.23.11\">2 K 23:11</a> +; c. ה loc. <span dir=\"rtl\">לִשְׁכָּ֑תָה</span> <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 9:22\" href=\"/I_Samuel.9.22\">1 S 9:22</a>; pl. <span dir=\"rtl\">לְשָׁכוֹת</span> <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 40:17\" href=\"/Ezekiel.40.17\">Ez 40:17</a> +; cstr. <span dir=\"rtl\">לִשְׁכוֹת</span> <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 10:38\" href=\"/Nehemiah.10.38\">Ne 10:38</a> +;—"},{"senses":[{"senses":[{"definition":"of room connected with a sanctuary <span dir=\"rtl\">(בָּמָה)</span>, where sacrif. meal was eaten <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 9:22\" href=\"/I_Samuel.9.22\">1 S 9:22</a>, insert also prob. <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 1:18\" href=\"/I_Samuel.1.18\">1:18</a> (𝔊 We Dr Klo Bu)."}],"num":"a."},{"senses":[{"definition":"connected with Sol.’s temple, where wine offered to Rechabites <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 35:2\" href=\"/Jeremiah.35.2\">Je 35:2</a>, <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 35:4\" href=\"/Jeremiah.35.4\">4</a>, cf. v <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 35:4\" href=\"/Jeremiah.35.4\">4</a><sup>(×2)</sup>; one where prophecy read <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 36:10\" href=\"/Jeremiah.36.10\">36:10</a> (both these appar. open, cf. Gie <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 35:2\" href=\"/Jeremiah.35.2\">Je 35:2</a>); cf. <span dir=\"rtl\">לִשְׁכַּת נְתַן־מֶלֶךְ הַסָּרִיס</span>.. <span dir=\"rtl\">בַּפַּרְוָרִים</span> <a data-ref=\"II Kings 23:11\" href=\"/II_Kings.23.11\">2 K 23:11</a>; used of Levites’ cells <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 9:33\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.9.33\">1 Ch 9:33</a>; = store-rooms v <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 9:26\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.9.26\">26</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">אֹצָרוֹת</span>, <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 23:28\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.23.28\">23:28</a>; <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 28:12\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.28.12\">28:12</a> <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 31:11\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.31.11\">2 Ch 31:11</a>."}],"num":"b."},{"senses":[{"definition":"in Ezek.’s temple, cells for priests, singers, etc. <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 40:17\" href=\"/Ezekiel.40.17\">Ez 40:17</a><sup>(×2)</sup>, <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 40:38\" href=\"/Ezekiel.40.38\">38</a>, <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 40:44\" href=\"/Ezekiel.40.44\">44</a>, <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 40:45\" href=\"/Ezekiel.40.45\">45</a>, <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 40:46\" href=\"/Ezekiel.40.46\">46</a> + <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 41:10\" href=\"/Ezekiel.41.10\">41:10</a> (del. Co Bthl), <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 42:1\" href=\"/Ezekiel.42.1\">42:1</a>, <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 42:4\" href=\"/Ezekiel.42.4\">4</a>, <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 42:7\" href=\"/Ezekiel.42.7\">7</a><sup>(×2)</sup>, <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 42:8\" href=\"/Ezekiel.42.8\">8</a>, <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 42:11\" href=\"/Ezekiel.42.11\">11</a> + v <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 42:12\" href=\"/Ezekiel.42.12\">12</a> (del. Co Bthl); in three tiers, cf. <span dir=\"rtl\">הַלְּ׳ הָעֶלְיוֹנֹת</span> <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 42:5\" href=\"/Ezekiel.42.5\">42:5</a> (vid. v <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 42:3\" href=\"/Ezekiel.42.3\">3</a>), (<a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 45:5\" href=\"/Ezekiel.45.5\">45:5</a> read <span dir=\"rtl\">עָרִים לָשֶׁבֶת</span> 𝔊 Sm Co Sgfr<sup>KauAT</sup> Bthl); <span dir=\"rtl\">ל׳ הַקֹּדֶשׁ</span> for sacred uses <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 42:13\" href=\"/Ezekiel.42.13\">42:13</a><sup>(×3)</sup>; <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 44:19\" href=\"/Ezekiel.44.19\">44:19</a>; <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 46:19\" href=\"/Ezekiel.46.19\">46:19</a>."}],"num":"c."},{"senses":[{"definition":"in second temple, as store-rooms <a data-ref=\"Ezra 8:29\" href=\"/Ezra.8.29\">Ezr 8:29</a> <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 10:38\" href=\"/Nehemiah.10.38\">Ne 10:38</a>, <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 10:39\" href=\"/Nehemiah.10.39\">39</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">בֵּית הָאוֹצָר</span>), v <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 10:40\" href=\"/Nehemiah.10.40\">40</a>; used by individuals <a data-ref=\"Ezra 10:6\" href=\"/Ezra.10.6\">Ezr 10:6</a> <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 13:5\" href=\"/Nehemiah.13.5\">Ne 13:5</a> <span dir=\"rtl\">(ל׳ גְּדוֹלָה)</span>, v <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 13:8\" href=\"/Nehemiah.13.8\">8</a>, in gen. v <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 13:4\" href=\"/Nehemiah.13.4\">4</a>, <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 13:9\" href=\"/Nehemiah.13.9\">9</a>."}],"num":"d."}],"num":"1."},{"senses":[{"definition":"of scribe’s room in royal palace <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 36:12\" href=\"/Jeremiah.36.12\">Je 36:12</a>, <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 36:20\" href=\"/Jeremiah.36.20\">20</a>, <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 36:21\" href=\"/Jeremiah.36.21\">21</a>."}],"num":"2."}]},"rid":"BDB04991","strong_numbers":["3957"],"next_hw":"לֶשֶׁם","prev_hw":"לשׁך","all_cited":true,"quotes":[],"GK":["4384"],"TWOT":["1129a"],"parent_lexicon_details":{"name":"BDB Dictionary","language":"heb.biblical","to_language":"eng","text_categories":[],"source":"BDB Dictionary","attribution":"F. Brown, S. Driver & C. Briggs","index_title":"BDB","version_title":"A Hebrew and English lexicon of the Old Testament, by Francis Brown. With the co-operation of S. R. Driver and Charles A. Briggs. Oxford, 1906","version_lang":"en","should_autocomplete":true}}